{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54708","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 四十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 四十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日之外，有耳两边生。\n必有和通同好事（辛本、川本作「善」，京本作「同通好喜」），两军不战结欢欣（京本作「情」），四海得安宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}